# Selected analytic route and exposure

This bounded author investigation was requested by root. Root supplied the fixed-inventory question, the saturated-v1 discriminator, and the possibility of a different direct endpoint plus window contract. Root did not supply the weak-path, polynomial determinant or augmented-recurrence arguments explored here. This author wrote the previous accessible-pair mediator, joint-readiness and selection-memo sources; this is source-exposed new research, not independent checking.

Selected route: enclose every fixed plant factor in a finite lattice box and add a weak positive Heisenberg Hamiltonian path through all sites, with fresh fillers retained. Investigate endpoint X/Y control, full-space computable compilation and a declared finite window. In particular test the chronology problem by carrying actual H0 aging as a second, uncontrolled compact-group coordinate. Distinguish a supplied external one-port waveform from a finite prepared autonomous controller.

No scientific execution is selected. Analytic proofs must carry geometry, arbitrary inputs/references, phases, finite actual time, positive loads, output-window drift, calibration and supplier limits. Metadata commands do not verify those proofs. No numerical matrix, gate-search or historical runner will be executed merely to obtain PASS lines.

Only this directory may be written. Existing packets, W, Git refs, prompts, axioms and audit/checkpoint/lock files remain untouched. Model and effort inherited, no delegation.
